"What did you do on your first day at the office?" she asks.
I met my colleague Jonas right away in the morning.
I took my laptop out of the backpack.
Then Jonas and I drank a coffee together.
While doing that, I set up my desk.
"That sounds like a good start," Timo says.
Then Lena asks what I am doing now.
"I have a lot to do at the moment," I answer.
But yesterday Jonas and I finished a big project.
We worked very hard every day last week.
"Have you already celebrated the project?" Timo asks.
"Not yet," I say.
But we have planned a meal with the team for Friday.
